        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bryan Beller, Joe Satriani, Mike Keneally, Steve Vai, James LaBrie, Dweezil Zappa, Alex DePue, Ann Marie Calhoun, Jeremy Colson, Dave Weiner, Zack Wiesinger\n- Organizations: The Aristocrats, Dethklok, Dream Theater, Adult Swim\n- Products: Metalocalypse, Where the Wild Things Are\n- Roles: bass guitarist, violin, keyboards, drums, guitar, sitar, lap steel\n\nFacts:\n- Bryan Beller was born on May 6, 1971.\n- Bryan Beller is an American bass guitarist.\n- Bryan Beller is known for his work with Joe Satriani, The Aristocrats, Dethklok, Mike Keneally, Steve Vai, James LaBrie of Dream Theater, and Dweezil Zappa.\n- Dethklok is a virtual death metal band featured in the Adult Swim animated television series Metalocalypse.\n- On Steve Vai's album Where the Wild Things Are, Steve Vai is joined on stage by Alex DePue on violin and keyboards, Ann Marie Calhoun on violin and keyboards, Bryan Beller on bass, Jeremy Colson on drums, Dave Weiner on guitar and sitar, and Zack Wiesinger on lap steel.",
